{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1448797-the-dramatic-dramatic-editing-thread","id":1448797,"title":"The Dramatic Dramatic Editing Thread","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-05-17T12:45:14-07:00","id":1448797,"title":"The Dramatic Dramatic Editing Thread","content":"I love Dramatic Editing.<br /> <br /> I thought it would be fun to create a thread where folks can document entertaining/exciting/unexpected uses of Dramatic Editing in their games. I would start, but nobody used Dramatic Editing in the game I ran so far.<br /> <br /> So what fun examples of DE have happened in your games lately (or ever)? Do you all have a favorite moment?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26842-alizerin","name":"Alizerin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-18T03:41:13-07:00","id":1448838,"title":"","content":"A couple years ago when we were playing 1e Adventure! the outlaw Scalper Dutch shot one of the PCs in the chest at point blank range and he walked away unharmed (except for a nasty bruise on his chest) by using Dramatic Editing because the bullet basically bounced off his gold cigarette case.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-24T13:14:07-07:00","id":1449483,"title":"","content":"A character was about to be poisoned by an ally with a glass of wine. The glass slipped from it's fingers and the poison was spilled on the ground. (Maybe this should be inspired defense other than dramatic edit).<br /> <br /> Later this character avoided an attack falling through the balcony into a truck full of pillows that was passing by the street.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25829-vjornin","name":"Vjornin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"44"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-24T13:43:27-07:00","id":1449487,"title":"","content":"A few years ago I ended an A! 1e session on a cliffhanger. The party was fighting a group of ninjas in a steam filled bath house. Two party members had been overpowered and disarmed and the third appeared to be decapitated by an enemy swordsman. At the start of the next session the apparently dead player spent all of his available Inspiration to have disguised himself as one of the ninjas in the steam and confusion. It turned out he hadn't been decapitated, he had decapitated one of the attackers. The other players then used the distraction of the reveal to escape their bonds and rearm themselves.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6-slagheap","name":"Slagheap","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"188"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-24T15:47:34-07:00","id":1449491,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Slagheap</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1448797-the-dramatic-dramatic-editing-thread?p=1449487#post1449487\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">A few years ago I ended an A! 1e session on a cliffhanger. The party was fighting a group of ninjas in a steam filled bath house. Two party members had been overpowered and disarmed and the third appeared to be decapitated by an enemy swordsman. At the start of the next session the apparently dead player spent all of his available Inspiration to have disguised himself as one of the ninjas in the steam and confusion. It turned out he hadn't been decapitated, he had decapitated one of the attackers. The other players then used the distraction of the reveal to escape their bonds and rearm themselves.</div> </div> </div> </div>This sounds AWESOME! Very pulp. Very awesome. Very like all eyes turn to the player as he describes the save, a save that would often be repeated among the game group. So yeah this sounds really really cool.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/661-lordheru","name":"LordHeru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar661_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-24T18:01:01-07:00","id":1449499,"title":"","content":"I remember one of my first cliffhangers was literally a cliff hanging scene, with the car upside down almost falling a cliff and the characters partially unconscious and almost in the hands of the enemy that were chasing them. Starting the next session the characters inspired them to conscious and got a few enemies by surprise when they went check for the bodies.<br /> <br /> Not a big deal, but the cliff and the characters hanging there was a funny joke to me and the players that were new to this English thing...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}